class Solution {
    public String gcdOfStrings(String str1, String str2) {
        // If concatenations don't match, no common divisor string exists
        if(!(str1+str2).equals(str2+str1)){
            return "";
        }
        
        // Find gcd of lengths
        int gcdLen = gcd(str1.length(), str2.length());
        
        // Return prefix of str1 with length gcdLen
        return str1.substring(0, gcdLen);
    }
    
    // Helper function to compute gcd
    private int gcd(int a, int b){
        return b==0 ? a : gcd(b, a%b);
    }
}


Time Complexity: O(n + m), where n and m are lengths of the strings (due to concatenation check).
Space Complexity: O(n + m) for concatenated strings.
